<title>USA: F.N.B. Corp declares stock dividend.</title>
<headline>F.N.B. Corp declares stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HERMITAGE, Pa. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>F.N.B. Corp's board has declared a five percent stock dividend payable May 31 to shareholders of record as of May 1.</p>
<p>It was the 25th consecutive year the company has paid a dividend. The company has about 13 million shares of common stock outstanding held by 5,348 investors.</p>
<p>F.N.B. has assets of more than $2.5 billion and operates eight banks and one consumer finance unit through 107 offices in Pennsylvania, Florida, Ohio and New York.</p>
